m/#organization"}},{"@type":"BlogPosting","headline":"BIM Outsourcing for Saudi Arabia Projects","description":"How to outsource BIM work for Saudi projects: remote teams, onsite placements, working-week alignment with the UAE, standards and what to agree up front.","url":"https://engisoftengineering.com/insights/bim-staffing/bim-outsourcing-saudi-arabia/","mainEntityOfPage":"https://engisoftengineering.com/insights/bim-staffing/bim-outsourcing-saudi-arabia/","datePublished":"2026-10-30T09:00:00+04:00","dateModified":"2026-10-30T09:00:00+04:00","image":"https://engisoftengineering.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found.jpg","articleSection":"BIM Staffing Insights","wordCount":285,"author":{"@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#organization"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#organization"},"inLanguage":"en"}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://engisoftengineering.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Insights","item":"https://engisoftengineering.com/insights/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"BIM Staffing Insights","item":"https://engisoftengineering.com/insights/bim-staffing/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"BIM Outsourcing for Saudi Arabia Projects","item":"https://engisoftengineering.com/insights/bim-staffing/bim-outsourcing-saudi-arabia/"}]}]}],"caseStudy":false,"main":"\n<section class=\"ph\"><img class=\"ph-media\" srcset=\"/assets/img/onsite-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/onsite.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/assets/img/onsite.jpg\" alt=\"Engineer in a hard hat reviewing a model on a tablet on site\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><div class=\"ph-in\"><div><p class=\"crumb ph-a\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> / <a href=\"/insights/\">Insights</a> / <a href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/\">BIM Staffing Insights</a> / BIM Outsourcing for Saudi Arabia Projects</p><h1 class=\"h1 ph-a\">BIM Outsourcing for Saudi Arabia Projects</h1></div><p class=\"lead ph-a\">Saudi programmes are creating demand for BIM capacity faster than local hiring can follow. How remote and regional BIM support can fit in.</p></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap article\">\n  <article class=\"art-main\">\n    <figure class=\"art-fig\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"432\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-768x432.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Aerial view of foundations and a steel frame on a construction site\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 760px\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-768x432.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-300x169.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-1024x576.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-1536x864.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found.jpg 1920w\" /></figure>    <div class=\"prose\"><p>The scale of construction in Saudi Arabia means many consultants and contractors need more BIM capacity than they can hire locally in time. Outsourcing part of the work to a regional provider is one way to close the gap. Doing it well comes down to a few practical points.</p>\n<h2>Choose the right model</h2>\n<p>Three models are common: <strong>dedicated remote teams</strong> working in your CDE, <strong>BIM packages</strong> delivered against a defined scope, and <strong>onsite placements</strong> where visa and contract arrangements allow. Many programmes combine a small onsite presence with a larger remote team.</p>\n<h2>Align working weeks and hours</h2>\n<p>Saudi Arabia works Sunday to Thursday and is one hour behind the UAE. A UAE-based provider that works Saturday to Thursday, as ENGISOFT does, covers every Saudi working day. Agree overlap hours and a reporting cadence at the start.</p>\n<h2>Agree the information standard</h2>\n<p>Large Saudi programmes usually issue their own BIM requirements. Make sure the outsourced team works to your BEP, naming and CDE rules from day one; a <a href=\"/bim-services/bim-execution-plan/\">BEP review</a> before work starts avoids rework later.</p>\n<h2>Protect the data</h2>\n<p>Access should follow your security policy: named accounts, controlled permissions and no local copies unless agreed. Write security terms into the contract rather than relying on general assurances.</p>\n<h2>Check onsite arrangements early</h2>\n<p>If some roles must be onsite, confirm visa and contractual arrangements during shortlisting, not after selection. Some roles may be better kept remote.</p>\n<h2>Be clear about experience</h2>\n<p>Ask providers which Saudi or GCC projects they have delivered and verify them. ENGISOFT&#8217;s case studies include the sea water system division of the Jazan IGCC project for ARAMCO with China Harbour, alongside landmark UAE work.</p>\n<p>More on how we support Saudi projects is on our <a href=\"/locations/saudi-arabia/\">Saudi Arabia page</a>.</p>\n</div>\n  </article>\n  <aside class=\"art-side\">\n    <div class=\"cbox\">\n      <h3>About this article</h3>\n      <span>Published <time datetime=\"2026-10-30T09:00:00+04:00\">October 30, 2026</time></span>\n      <span>1 min read</span>\n      <span>Written by the ENGISOFT BIM delivery team</span>\n      <span>Technically reviewed <time datetime=\"2026-11-13\">November 13, 2026</time></span>      <a class=\"u\" href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/\">More on BIM Staffing Insights</a>    </div>\n    <div class=\"art-rel\"><p class=\"lab\">Related pages</p><ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/locations/saudi-arabia/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Saudi Arabia</b><span>Locations</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Remote BIM Staffing</b><span>BIM Staffing</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Dedicated BIM Teams</b><span>BIM Staffing</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-execution-plan/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Execution Planning</b><span>Strategy</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div>\n    <a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/contact/\">Discuss your project <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a>\n  </aside>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Keep reading</p><h2 class=\"h2\">BIM Staffing Insights, <em>continued.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/insights/\">All insights <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <div class=\"sgrid\">\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/choose-bim-staffing-company/\"><div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Architectural drawing on a desk with a pen\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n    <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">OCT 2026</span><h3 class=\"h3\">How to Choose a BIM Staffing Company</h3><span class=\"sv-go\">Read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div></a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/onsite-vs-remote-bim-staffing/\"><div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Engineer in a hard hat reviewing a model on a tablet on site\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n    <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">OCT 2026</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Onsite vs Remote BIM Staffing</h3><span class=\"sv-go\">Read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div></a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/hire-bim-engineers-dubai/\"><div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Silhouette of the Dubai skyline at sunset\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n    <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">OCT 2026</span><h3 class=\"h3\">How to Hire Qualified BIM Engineers in Dubai</h3><span class=\"sv-go\">Read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div></a>\n      </div>\n</div></section>\n","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/c-site-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/c-site.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/assets/img/c-site.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a cleared construction site\" loading=\"lazy\">    <p class=\"lab\">Next step</p><h2 class=\"display\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Talk to the team <em>behind the article.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/request-talent/\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"tel:+971588672901\">+971 58 867 2901</a></div>"}